--TEST--
A string literal under `as class<T>` naming a class outside `T`'s hierarchy does not compile, under the code `Rock::class as class<Animal>` gets — `rule:types/class-reference`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Animal {}
class Rock {}
class<Animal> $c = 'Rock' as class<Animal>;
echo $c as string, "\n";
